to-be-incorporated-into-paper-171 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-171 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: `▸ κ A` is an `A` one tick of the clock `κ` later: the Π type `(α : Tick κ) → A`. A tick is bound" (cons "by λ and given by application, and nothing else: `Clock` and `Tick κ` are the domains of Π types" (cons "only, in no universe, so a tick cannot be stored, returned, or let-bound. The checker's" (cons (quoted (cons "timelessness rule makes " (cons "later" (cons " mean later: in the body of a tick λ, a function applied to the" nil)))) (cons "tick α may use no variable bound at or after α. So `λ α → x α α` is rejected (one tick spent" (cons "twice) and `λ α β → x α β` accepted. Interval variables are exempt: `λ α (i : I) → p i α` turns a" (cons "path of later values into a later path, and `λ (i : I) α → p α i` turns it back. This is sound" (cons (quoted (cons "because the interval does not vary in time: the " (cons "earlier" (cons " of a context extended by an interval" nil)))) (cons "is the earlier context extended by the interval, ◁(Γ × I) ≅ ◁Γ × I, as in the cubical models of" (cons "guarded type theory." nil))))))))))
